    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just not fair. it feels like i'm just a ghost walking around this house. everything feels pointless without him. sometimes i just sit here and think... what's the point of even trying to keep going when the best part of my life is already gone? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy body around for no reason.",
