      "content": "\"rest in the emptiness\"... that sounds so peaceful compared to this. i feel like i'm just waiting for nothing to happen anymore. sometimes i just stare at the door and wish i could just walk through it to wherever he is. it feels more like home than this house does. it feels like i'm just waiting to be done with all this pain.",
